## A real-life story

*"I arrived with blood pressure of 165/95 and three tablets a day. After fourteen days at the spa, my doctor reduced the dose to two and my blood pressure was 138/82. After three months at home — with the drinking cure and walks they recommended — I'm down to one tablet."*
— Jaroslav, 58, Pilsen

## How to get started

1. **Consult your doctor** — ask about a spa stay as part of your treatment plan
1. **Check your insurance** — some stays may be subsidised or covered by health insurance
1. [**Plan your trip**](/en/practical-information) — Marienbad is 2 hours from Prague
1. **Book your [accommodation](/en/accommodation)** — the longer the stay, the better the results
